{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10010_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:89d1924816bb84e9e4ae224d590fd9d018b828e7dfc09bf90692e92fc91e983c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_b:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1424f3ff4aab258999e6215ad083d463ad29cd26e706a8eee15c6855a6f8102",
      "text": "找我们的摩托车工作——！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37f5119495ccdffd547357f1aefe06e1f02fca26e308d1705548b414d4c38931",
      "text": "是的，没错！这次的工作是起用拍摄摩托车杂志的\nCM，并提供新歌……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee9610ca5418e19b827b74b728ade06b255b0e97aefba05b55d2866622629d6a",
      "text": "还有就是，希望你们能登上\n活动舞台！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13dbac7f4e42f8ad2ac62fe71c6975891cae2bf22e54becadaa16e30c55814f4",
      "text": "真、真的假的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0245d195400d991c3e2eeab646d689c7513cb25a9fcee04db374e3031f9272d3",
      "text": "甚至连新歌都能用上啊。\n这不是一份最热血、最棒的工作嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:001e63174913041c14ca09dd30751d9dede4aca5bea48898e385bc56e43f53f4",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●番长。\n那本最重要的摩托车杂志是哪本？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47dfb08355a38fcb3993166c289cf19650dc7dd07385d179718d0542c446b525",
      "text": "这就是最新一期。\n请看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e03e79a07f7ac2746f7766171aac32379e731727521ea7c6904576899e147598",
      "text": "嗯？这是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aad257c59f84e7d73c9f1a10186d4ec3b82bf91b09129fb1ffc79a40bd139ed3",
      "text": "什……么啊。那本杂志，\n不就是我刚才买来的那本吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d33ba2aa4043de0f0f24f6c6a9ee4ca013b2d283196432cb7e95eb2b50b5aea8",
      "text": "你们看！我可是每个月雷打不动都在买的！\n糟、太糟糕了……这也太开心了吧！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_b:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e9326684aae4f5d52aaa2600b0897eeb630548196c32dc91b0f2ed5cb3e8f33",
      "text": "（朱雀先生看起来好高兴。\n我也得加把劲了……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_b:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:374c6c11e8d7d3748fce92c788127852723ade5a969575b6750112c96c7f3757",
      "text": "咕～，太棒了……！\n这下可得彻底拿出干劲来了啊！！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
